's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"4d44c1148fb125b0e88ae6408a96427d","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"158f74035533000c5c07c95dac65d0d3","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"957916099c847162037fd3a7120195b6","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ece548debc05cf7dc5ffcc869786e208","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"d07597f370a0f713df23cd1f62366223","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"b594100aec865aaea342960789d7f1de","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"7c48d2d2a53f03ebbe17daff1a5016ed","originalFileName":"9f799223-64b8-4f0e-9d93-3afac967826a-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"a8c04bc2